      <VERS vnumber="3">
        <gr str="3588">For</gr>, <gr str="2009">lo</gr>, they lie in <gr str="693">wait </gr>for my <gr str="5315">soul</gr>: the <gr str="5794">mighty </gr>are <gr str="1481">gathered </gr>
