        <gr str="898">transgressors</gr>. <gr str="5542">Selah</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6"> They <gr str="7725">return </gr>at <gr str="6153">evening</gr>: they make a <gr str="1993">noise </gr>like a <gr str="3611">dog</gr>, and go round <gr str="5437">about </gr>the <gr str="5892">city</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="7">
        <gr str="2009">Behold</gr>, they belch <gr str="5042">out </gr>with their <gr str="6310">mouth</gr>: <gr str="2719">swords </gr>
