      <VERS vnumber="14"> And at <gr str="6153">evening </gr>let them <gr str="7725">return</gr>; <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> and </STYLE> let them make a <gr str="1993">noise </gr>like a <gr str="3611">dog</gr>, and go round <gr str="5437">about </gr>the <gr str="5892">city</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="15"> Let <gr str="1992">them </gr>wander up and <gr str="5128">down </gr>for <gr str="398">meat</gr>, and <gr str="3885">grudge </gr>
